// purpose: Detecting Unauthorized RMM Instances in Your MDE Environment
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/Detecting%20Unauthorized%20RMM%20Instances%20in%20Your%20MDE%20Environment.kql
